WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.102
-It is time for
"Tonight Show Hashtags"!

00:00:03.102 --> 00:00:04.737
-♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:07.674
♪♪

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:09.609
♪ Hashtags ♪

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.843
♪♪

00:00:10.843 --> 00:00:12.312
-Ah, very nice.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:13.579
We do this thing every week

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:15.848
where I send out a hashtag,
and you guys --

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.817
ask you guys to respond
to that topic.

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.685
So with football
back in full swing,

00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:23.022 line:0%
I started a hashtag called
#NewFootballTraditions.

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:25.258 line:0%
And I asked you guys
to tweet out some new ideas

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:28.595
for the football season that are
more appropriate for 2020.

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.296
Within minutes, it was
a trending topic,

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:31.764
so thank you
for playing along.

00:00:31.764 --> 00:00:33.066
I appreciate that.

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:35.134
And now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:38.070
new football traditions
responses from you guys.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.573
This first one's from
@harlieghg.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:44.743
She says, "Running through the
Lysol tunnel before kickoff."

00:00:44.743 --> 00:00:47.313
That's actually a good idea.
We should get one here.

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:48.581
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:49.915
Uh...I'd do it.

00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:53.152
This one's from @JEMetalHead96.

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:57.190
He says, "Instead of tackling,
players shout, 'Got you!'"

00:00:57.190 --> 00:01:01.761
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.829 --> 00:01:06.666
This one's from @Grundy.

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:09.702
Ooh. Grundy.
-Grundy.

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:11.504
You would say it
as "Grundy"?

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:14.040
-Grundy.
It's in the game.

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.241
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.241 --> 00:01:18.378
-I think you're right.

00:01:18.378 --> 00:01:19.945
This one is from @Grundy.
He says,

00:01:19.945 --> 00:01:22.115
"Interviewing the winning coach
with one of those

00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:25.484
long 'The Price Is Right" mics
to maintain social distance.

00:01:25.484 --> 00:01:27.554
A six-foot mic.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:30.323
Uh...

00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:33.826
This one's from
@Canne57.

00:01:33.826 --> 00:01:35.395
Her new football tradition --

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.963
"Fifty cardboard cutouts
standing in line

00:01:36.963 --> 00:01:38.297
for the bathroom."

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:40.132
It's like,
"Ah, you gotta be kidding me."

00:01:40.132 --> 00:01:42.835
You got to make the experience
authentic.

00:01:42.835 --> 00:01:45.104
This one's from
@tmomerling.

00:01:45.104 --> 00:01:47.873
She says, "Facemask
no longer a penalty."

00:01:47.873 --> 00:01:49.742
Ah!
-Ah!

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.245
-That's a good one.
That's a good one right there.

00:01:52.245 --> 00:01:54.613
[ Laughs ]
Uh...

00:01:54.613 --> 00:01:57.950
This one's from
@carriesmith1123.

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.952
She says, "Instead
of marriage proposals,

00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:01.620
the Jumbotron
will just be used

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:03.690
to FaceTime
players' grandparents.

00:02:03.690 --> 00:02:05.624
[ Chuckles ]

00:02:05.624 --> 00:02:09.229
"Grandpa, the stadium can only
see your nostrils."

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:12.832
Uh, this one's from
@liberal nacho.

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:15.201
[ Laughter ]
-Okay.

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:18.704
-He says, "Coronavirus tip --
wear a New York Jets jersey

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:20.506
and you won't catch
anything."

00:02:20.506 --> 00:02:21.774
-Oh!
-Hey!

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:22.942
-Whoo!

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:25.578
-Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.016
This last one's from
@IntheZane.

00:02:31.016 --> 00:02:33.353
In the Zane.
Yeah.

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:36.089
Get in the --
Get in the lane, Auto Zane.

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:37.890
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.326
-She says,
"After winning,

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:42.829
players say, 'I'm going
to Disney...Plus!'"

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.430
There you have it.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.933
Those are our "Tonight Show
Hashtags," everybody.

00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.801
Thank you so much. To check out
more of our favorites,

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:51.604 line:0%
go to
tonightshow.com/hashtags.

